              "subtitle": "Request & approval workflow",
              "text": {
                "$html": "<p>A multi-step approval process with roles (requester, reviewer, admin), a server-enforced state machine, a complete audit trail and a board that updates in real time. Exactly the kind of internal software no off-the-shelf product covers.</p>"
              },
